#
# What this container has to be told once it has booted.
#
# 1. Retire LineageOS' setup wizard.
# 2. Take the container's own volume control out of the signal path.
#
# Android here is an app runtime, not a phone: nobody will ever click through
# a setup wizard.  LineageOS' wizard holds the HOME role with priority until
# it has been completed, and an unfinished one puts itself in front of
# whatever is launched — the app the user tapped in the OHOS grid never gets a
# window.  Marking Android provisioned (the compositor's control plane does
# that through IPlatform) does not retire it: it keeps its own completion flag
# in LineageOS' settings provider.  Disabling the package does, and launcher3
# takes HOME over (the compositor never shows HOME, see IsHomePackage).
#
# Done from init because it has to come from a real process of this
# container: the host can reach binder services, but `pm`/`cmd` started from
# outside hang (no caller identity).  Persistent in data.img and idempotent,
# so after the first boot this is a no-op.

# Volume is applied twice on this device and only one of the two controls is
# reachable.  Android attenuates a track by its own STREAM_MUSIC index, and
# then waydroid_audio hands the result to an OHOS AudioRenderer, which
# attenuates it again by the OHOS media volume.  The phone's volume keys move
# the OHOS one; nothing in our integration surfaces Android's, so it sits at
# whatever the image shipped — 5 of 15, about -33 dB — and multiplies with
# the OHOS setting.  Stacked, the two cost roughly -49 dB and the container
# is barely audible.
#
# So pin the container to unity gain and let OHOS own volume outright: one
# attenuator, at the end of the chain, on the volume keys.  Only STREAM_MUSIC
# is set here, which is what app and video audio uses; the other streams keep
# the image's defaults so notification and alarm sounds stay in proportion.
on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    exec_background - root root -- /system/bin/pm disable-user --user 0 org.lineageos.setupwizard
    exec_background - root root -- /system/bin/cmd media_session volume --stream 3 --set 15
